  "description": "Introducing the Wired Scout - the step-thru version of our powerful Wired Warrior! UL2849 certified with UL2271 certified batteries, featuring the same exclusive 2000W Hengtai geared motor in an accessible, easy-to-mount frame design.\n\nThe Scout delivers approximately 5000W at peak power with dual 72V high-discharge Samsung batteries that provide exceptional range and performance when you need it most.\n\nStep-Thru Frame with Full Dual Suspension: Easy mounting with front and rear suspension for maximum comfort\n\nPerfect For\n\nThe Scout combines the accessibility of a step-thru frame with the raw power of our Warrior platform and the safety of UL2849/UL2271 certifications. Whether you're commuting daily or exploring off-road trails, the dual suspension system and powerful motor make every ride comfortable and exhilarating. The step-thru design makes it ideal for riders of all ages and abilities.\n\nWhy Choose the Scout?\n\nGet the same powerful performance as the Warrior in a more accessible step-thru package with industry-leading safety certifications. The exclusive Hengtai motor and dual 72V Samsung battery system deliver uncompromising power, while the step-thru frame, dual suspension, and UL2849/UL2271 certifications ensure comfort, ease of use, and peace of mind for every rider.",
